Search "stage lighting rental" and most results settle into the same vague categories: moving heads, laser installations, GoBo projectors, a general "LED lighting solutions" line. None of it is named by brand or model, and some of it describes equipment that does not exist in every supplier's warehouse, ours included. This page does the opposite. Every real stage lighting fixture Malaga Event Gear (MEG) owns is named below, by brand and model, tied to a real euro price where one exists, alongside a direct list of what we don't stock.

MEG owns and delivers every fixture on this page ourselves, tested before every event, across Malaga and the wider Costa del Sol, backed by experience going back to 1996. Nothing here is a wishlist. Each item is either real inventory with a published price, or an honest "quote on request."

## Brief Overview

---

Malaga Event Gear supplies stage lighting for corporate events, weddings and celebrations across Malaga and the wider Costa del Sol: 2 Eurolite LED KLS-200 light bars, 1 ADJ Encore FRI50Z Fresnel wash light, 1 ADJ Element H6 Pack wireless uplighting kit, 2 RGBW LED spotlight bars bundled into the [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/), and fairy lights bundled into the [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/). Delivery, setup, testing and collection are part of every rental, handled by our own crew rather than shipped as a self assembly kit. [Contact us](/contact/) to match a fixture or package to your event.

