## The Full Stage Lighting Roster: Every Real Fixture We Stock, By Brand and Model

Five real products make up MEG's stage lighting inventory, and this is the only page on our site that gathers all five in one place.

**2x Eurolite LED KLS-200.** A 4 head LED light bar with foot pedal control, used for accent and wash lighting on larger corporate stages and specialty setups. We own 2 units. It is not bundled into any of our 5 packages, so [contact us](/contact/) with your venue and guest count and we will confirm availability and a quote.

**1x ADJ Encore FRI50Z.** A fixed zoom Fresnel wash light, the kind of steady, adjustable beam used to wash a speaker, a podium or a stage feature in even light rather than a color changing effect. Also a separate, quote on request item.

**1x ADJ Element H6 Pack.** A wireless, battery powered uplighting kit of 6 fixtures, for washing a wall, backdrop or structure with color from the floor rather than spotlighting a fixed point. Realistically, 6 fixtures cover accent lighting for 2 to 4 venue features, an entrance, a head table, a run of columns, or one feature wall, not a full room wash. It is a separate item from our uplighting kit's colored spotlights below, with its own quote.

**2 RGBW LED light bars, [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/).** A color changing accent fixture, delivered and set up by our crew as part of the package, then run without a technician for the rest of your event. Published at 290 euros ex VAT for up to 50 guests.

**Fairy lights / warm LED strings, [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/).** Warm LED strings for romantic ambient lighting, included at 650 euros ex VAT for up to 80 guests, alongside a technician who stays on site for the event.

