## Foot Pedal Control, Not DMX: What "Programmable" Actually Means Here

A general search for stage lighting rental often implies DMX programmable fixtures, moving heads that pan and tilt on cue, or a lighting console a technician runs from a script. That is not what MEG stocks, and we would rather correct that expectation here than let you find out on the day of your event.

The Eurolite LED KLS-200 bar is controlled by a foot pedal, a simple on stage switch a performer or technician presses to change the fixture's color or pattern, not a DMX signal sent from a lighting desk. The ADJ Encore FRI50Z Fresnel is a fixed zoom wash light with no automated movement. The ADJ Element H6 Pack uplighting kit has no published DMX or app based color control either: our technician sets the color for your event on site, based on what you tell us when you book, rather than handing you a remote or an app. None of our 3 specialty fixtures pan, tilt or follow a programmed cue sheet. If your event genuinely needs automated, DMX driven lighting, we would rather say so now, before you book, than after.

## Delivery, Setup, Testing and Collection: What We Mean By "Stage Lighting Installation"

Some searches for stage lighting rental are really asking about installation, whether a supplier just drops off boxes or actually sets the equipment up. At MEG, installation is not a separate service line with its own quote: it is bundled into every rental, for every fixture on this page.

Our crew delivers the fixtures to your venue, positions and aims them for the space, tests each one before your event starts, and returns to collect everything afterward. That is true for the Eco Pack's RGBW light bars, the Wedding Pack's fairy lights with a technician on site for the duration, and for the Eurolite bar, Fresnel and uplighting kit when you book them separately. We do not have a standalone "installation" business line the way a systems integrator that mounts permanent fixtures into a venue's ceiling would. If what you are picturing is a permanent lighting install for a venue you own or manage, that is outside our catalog: we deliver, set up, test and collect for your event, then take everything with us.

For a corporate presentation that also needs a raised platform, our [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) offers modular stage platforms as an optional add on, priced at 35 euros per square meter and sized to your room, delivered and struck the same way as our lighting.

