## What We Don't Stock

A general search for stage lighting in Malaga turns up categories that are not part of our catalog. Rather than stay quiet about it, here is the direct list:

-   **Moving head or intelligent lighting fixtures.** We do not own DMX pan and tilt robotic fixtures. Everything above is either fixed position or a foot pedal controlled bar, not an automated rig.

-   **DMX lighting controllers.** We do not stock a DMX control desk or software. The Eurolite bar's foot pedal is not a DMX control system.

-   **Truss systems.** We do not stock truss as a separate rental item. Our fixtures are stand mounted or floor placed by our crew, not rigged to an overhead truss structure.

-   **Follow spotlights, cold spark machines, strobe lights or blacklights.** None of these appear anywhere in our packages or equipment catalog. We won't invent a quote for a product we don't stock.

-   **Laser light shows or GoBo and monogram projection.** Our lighting inventory is limited to the 5 fixtures above. We do not run laser light shows or project a custom pattern or monogram onto a wall or dance floor.

If any of the above is what you actually need, we would rather tell you now than let you find out after describing your event to us on the phone. Our [equipment catalog](/equipment/) lists the full real inventory behind every package.

