## How Far in Advance to Book

Book as soon as your event date is confirmed. Demand on the Costa del Sol peaks during wedding season, from April through October, when technicians and our most requested fixtures fill up first. Because 2 of our 5 fixtures, the Eurolite bars, exist in only 2 units, and the uplighting kit has only 6 fixtures total, confirming your date early also gives us time to check they are genuinely free, on top of whichever package you have already booked.

## Conclusion

Stage lighting rental at Malaga Event Gear means 5 real products: 2 Eurolite LED KLS-200 bars on a foot pedal, an ADJ Encore FRI50Z Fresnel, an ADJ Element H6 Pack uplighting kit, RGBW spotlights on the Eco Pack, and fairy lights on the Wedding Pack, each one delivered, set up, tested and collected by our own crew. We do not stock moving heads, DMX controllers, truss, lasers, cold spark or strobes, and we would rather say so directly than let a general search imply otherwise. [Contact us](/contact/) with your venue and event details, and we will confirm what fixture or package fits.

## FAQs

### What Stage Lighting Equipment Does MEG Actually Stock?

Five real products: 2 Eurolite LED KLS-200 light bars, 1 ADJ Encore FRI50Z Fresnel, 1 ADJ Element H6 Pack (6 wireless uplights), 2 RGBW LED light bars on the [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/), and fairy lights on the [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/). See [The Full Stage Lighting Roster](#the-full-stage-lighting-roster-every-real-fixture-we-stock-by-brand-and-model) above.

### Is Your Stage Lighting DMX Controlled or Programmable?

No. The Eurolite bar runs on a foot pedal, the Fresnel is a fixed zoom wash light with no automated movement, and the uplighting kit's color is set by our technician on site, not through a DMX signal or an app. See [Foot Pedal Control, Not DMX](#foot-pedal-control-not-dmx-what-programmable-actually-means-here) above.

### Do You Offer Moving Head or Intelligent Lighting Fixtures?

No. We do not own DMX pan and tilt robotic fixtures. See [What We Don't Stock](#what-we-dont-stock) above.

### Is Delivery, Setup and Collection Included, or Is Installation Billed Separately?

Included, for every fixture on this page. We do not have a separate "installation" business line: our crew delivers, positions, tests and collects the equipment as part of the rental. See [Delivery, Setup, Testing and Collection](#delivery-setup-testing-and-collection-what-we-mean-by-stage-lighting-installation) above.

### How Much Does Stage Lighting Rental Cost in Malaga?

It depends on the fixture. The RGBW light bars are included at 290 euros ex VAT on the [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/), and the fairy lights are included at 650 euros ex VAT on the [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/). The Eurolite bars, the Fresnel and the uplighting kit have no published a la carte price: [contact us](/contact/) with your event details for a quote. See [Stage Lighting by Package](#stage-lighting-by-package-pricing-and-what-each-one-includes) above.

### Which MEG Packages Bundle Both Sound and Lighting Together?

Only 2: the [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) and the [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/). The [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/), [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/) and [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) all include sound, but their visual layer is a projection screen or LED display, not stage lighting. See [Stage Lighting by Package](#stage-lighting-by-package-pricing-and-what-each-one-includes) above for the exact breakdown.

### What Is the Difference Between Stage Lighting and Stage Uplighting?

Stage lighting, on this page, covers our full fixture roster: the Eurolite bars, the Fresnel, the RGBW spotlights and the uplighting kit together. Uplighting specifically is our ADJ Element H6 Pack, a wireless kit that washes a wall or structure with color from the floor, distinct from the Eurolite bar or Fresnel, which are fixed position wash and accent fixtures. We publish a deeper, dedicated guide on our uplighting kit alone, covering realistic venue coverage and outdoor use in more depth than this page does.

### Can Stage Lighting Be Rented Without a Full Sound or Staging Package?

Yes, for the 3 fixtures that are not bundled into a package: the Eurolite bars, the Fresnel and the uplighting kit are all separate, quote on request items. The RGBW spotlights and fairy lights, however, are only available as part of the [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) and [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) respectively, not as standalone rentals.

### Is Stage Lighting Available for Outdoor Events?

Yes, with an honest caveat. We have not confirmed a weatherproof or IP rating for any of our 3 specialty fixtures, so we do not market them as rated outdoor equipment. In practice, our technician assesses conditions on site, places fixtures around whatever shelter the venue offers, and recommends a covered backup position if rain is a real risk on your date.

### How Far in Advance Should I Book Stage Lighting for a Wedding or Corporate Event?

As early as your date is confirmed. Demand peaks during wedding season, from April through October, and 2 of our 5 fixtures exist in very limited quantity, 2 Eurolite bars and 6 uplights total, so early booking matters more here than for higher volume equipment. See [How Far in Advance to Book](#how-far-in-advance-to-book) above.

### Does Stage Lighting Rental Include a Technician, or Do I Run It Myself?

It depends on the fixture. The [Eco Pack's](/packages/eco/) RGBW light bars are set up and tested by our crew, then run without a technician for the rest of your event. The [Wedding Pack's](/packages/wedding/) fairy lights come with a technician on site for the event. The Eurolite bars, Fresnel and uplighting kit are deployed with a technician who manages placement and, for the uplighting kit, color.

### Is "Wireless Stage Lighting" the Same as Your Uplighting Kit?

Yes, all three search phrases point at the same real product in our catalog. We stock exactly one wireless lighting kit, the ADJ Element H6 Pack of 6 battery powered fixtures, so "wireless stage lighting," "stage uplighting" and "wireless uplighting" all resolve to that single item, not three different products.

### Can Stage Lighting Be Combined With Staging Platforms for a Corporate Presentation?

Yes. Our [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) offers modular stage platforms as an optional add on at 35 euros per square meter, delivered, set up and collected the same way as our lighting fixtures. [Contact us](/contact/) with your venue and we will confirm what combination fits your presentation.
